  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EDevelopment proposals \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould \u003C/strong\u003Ealso consider building massing to optimise solar exposure, ensuring taller buildings are located to the north of shorter buildings and open spaces to avoid creating negative impacts such as over-shadowing.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
